<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth traveled to Caracas and signed a military cooperation agreement with the interim Venezuelan government, reestablishing joint security efforts and labeling Venezuela a compliant security partner. A U.S. marine died after falling overboard during a Caribbean operation linked to the renewed military ties. Former oil minister Machado urged a more drastic overhaul of Venezuela's oil sector amid ongoing hyperinflation, food shortages, massive emigration and socioeconomic collapse. Two battle-related deaths occurred in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOM3VlUmtXdkJETU9WcE4tTVZzNGtzMFFxZ05LcG5IX1pwWkdhWjczSmlqUGt2UVpfUWx0SFhsVDJ4Q3pWX3k1Qjk5czZGRUlleEZEbTFkQ1p4QnpMLTc3YkpDVkotUThwbGo0Q3U3dmJlYVJISzBqNmd4Vlo3eWtCTGlZZHNKaWZSendTWkJVcWdSTzcxQjRpNHlVV2haUjA4cFg1U1E5Z2hDdEFnWWVWd1p3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFA5cU1uVUs3WmpaSE9lSnlvVFhHZDB5SF8xZ3hrUWhyRDRpbEZzQUd1QVdHdFVXbjg0TGJFRGx4QUtCTExaczJGQ0RrVE93azdCNnB5UC0zejBGa0RMb2Vj0gFcQVVfeXFMT3hlRm1XRFJmTzdDajU0WEtpWjhBeVh6WGNhMjZ0T1Y0VGNUUDFUMXB5Skk1WGZPY2NwTVJKVmZ4bHQ1Mkc4TjJNbEhrcjRqdHc1Tk96eHhjamN2Mnk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxONVQtRkQ1ZGRKaFRwQUp0d1prakkyMzZrd3V1Q0VSQzJrcG9Zd0U0OE5HeUtEUWUtanhJMHBVR0M5Sm1zNFpNMFNnSXNyMDY0djJ6a1l4Wkc1ZWZ0Sm03NTdoUndGc1BRZWJRLTUyQ2FaZ1ExMzk0ZTdlZm5ERTJ1MHNmTXV2RURUcy1KQjRPVW9raUtwckdoaW1WNVlyNlZwMzlSZ19TVVFuREh0UDl1bXZoQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Orinoco Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com